      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If its a big enough issue the world creator can most likely enforce some restrictions with Udon such as height limits if they wanted to. Otherwise I imagine it is up to the players to agree on such rules before entering.\nHaving the hidden avatars be the same height as they were before makes no sense outside some very few situations which include what you are asking for. In a way it also comes down to players abusing their heights to cheat in the game, which then needs to be countered with restrictions rather than bringing back the incorrect heights of a user when hidden.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
