  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Even though the feature to make them the same size as the current avatar they are in...like Extremely Small Robots or Extremely Large Bots......\nWhich in turn Breaks alot of the Games. Two perfect example from Jar's World.....Murder Maps and Among Us.\nlarge avatars is just game breaking period.....they can reach no matter and see the map \nbut the small ones are of annoyance.....\nUnless Udon has a feature that detects Heights?",
